Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.45,0:00:06.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Mel: Nope, I don't got stamina, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:08.28,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,(thud)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:10.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, that is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.13,0:00:11.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You're probably wondering how I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:14.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Kon-Melo, it's ya Tech Wizardess girl, MeloriTensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.73,0:00:16.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And before we get into this highlight,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I highly encourage you to check out the first highlight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:20.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,before you come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.22,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,guys, let's stock up on food first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:23.68,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,take a coconut half and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.68,0:00:24.25,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}COOK IT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:26.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1100,499)}A Coc-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.87,0:00:26.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(473,270)}coconut???
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.87,0:00:26.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(681,611)}cook??????
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:27.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Previously on PEAK Highlights Episode 1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.85,0:00:27.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.37,0:00:28.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You're back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:29.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:31.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Now, this highlight is gonna be a little bit different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.43,0:00:32.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be split in half,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:35.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,so there will be a part one and a part two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.48,0:00:37.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And the whole gang decided to run it back,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:39.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,except for my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:41.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So I've decided to add more friends into this group.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:45.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,However, they all have schedule issues, so, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.45,0:00:48.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we've got one person extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.15,0:00:48.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:53.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,However, it looks like somebody has forgotten to install the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:57.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,After having bought it on the literal hour, we're going live.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:00.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, without further ado, this is what we're doing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.42,0:01:02.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,before the stream starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:03.27,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Dasher: Quick, take a piss!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:03.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, we're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:06.83,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,KZF1: I woke up feeling dead at 5 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.32,0:01:09.22,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,"I woke up, I drank coffee at 8"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.33,0:01:11.35,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake} Hehehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:12.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Then play Limbus Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.93,0:01:16.28,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,"Y'see, I went to take a sleb,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.28,0:01:20.38,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,then I suddenly sleepwalked to my computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:23.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"And I am sleep playing Limbus Company."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.78,0:01:26.43,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,And reflexively- reflexively turned on Limbus Company
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.43,0:01:28.63,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,without being conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.63,0:01:32.03,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,And then I proceeded to MVP the next five games.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.82,0:01:34.65,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,All without me knowing."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.28,0:01:35.20,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,The E.G.O. must flow, as they say in Limbus Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:36.68,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,The E.G.O. must flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.77,0:01:38.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I do not remember having uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.77,0:01:40.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,having sent a friend request at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.90,0:01:41.30,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.82,0:01:44.43,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,The 21st night of December.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.82,0:01:44.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,(drunkenly) The 21st night of September.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.43,0:01:47.63,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,(absolutely unintelligible singing)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.43,0:01:47.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,(absolutely unintelligible singing)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.17,0:01:49.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Anyways, with that aside,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:50.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,hope you enjoyed the video.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.63,0:01:56.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.33,0:01:57.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe~
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.27,0:01:58.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Kon-Melo, Kon-Melo, Kon-Melo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:00.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's ya Tech Wizardess, MeloriTensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:03.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, streamer late for 14 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.78,0:02:07.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um, well, that's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:09.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,guess who was not ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.18,0:02:10.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,If you look at the top up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.90,0:02:10.68,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now: Waiting for {\c&HAE59C8}Yannick{\c} to be ready
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.68,0:02:11.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.35,0:02:14.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we have to sit here and wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.35,0:02:16.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for this one specific person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.18,0:02:18.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And his name is Yannick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:20.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine if you don't know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.13,0:02:24.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,He's recently been making, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.15,0:02:25.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,BeamNG videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.47,0:02:28.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm hoping to collab on BeamNG eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.15,0:02:28.75,Yannick Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(936,216.667)\fs60\c&HFFBFAA&}Sauce: @YaniboiAnd
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:33.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But at the moment, he's currently still trying to route cables.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.68,0:02:35.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But hey, on the bright side, we got the rest-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:37.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We got the rest of the gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.05,0:02:38.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So we got,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.08,0:02:40.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,uh, we got Chicken back for second round.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.40,0:02:42.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And we got Dasher back for second round as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.87,0:02:44.02,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.02,0:02:44.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hhh~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.02,0:02:45.50,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Were we supposed to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.70,0:02:46.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.32,0:02:46.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.03,0:02:48.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Hehehehahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.98,0:02:48.08,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh yes. Ahh yes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.08,0:02:49.02,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't supposed to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.38,0:02:49.70,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:50.02,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your mouth shut. (lol)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:50.90,Yannick Default,,0,0,0,,Yannick: I'm also not sure if I should be talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:51.48,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Hehahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.60,0:02:51.48,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.60,0:02:53.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Anyways, we also have Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.55,0:02:56.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I'm not sure how else I can address you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.82,0:02:57.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.22,0:02:58.18,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Address you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.35,0:03:02.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You're one of the OG chatters during my Twitch era on, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.60,0:03:04.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,on my streaming career.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.63,0:03:04.83,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Alexvvkk: Tower Battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:06.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:08.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, those days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.05,0:03:09.97,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.45,0:03:11.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I find it funny that you found me through Tower Battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.18,0:03:12.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.87,0:03:14.68,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, the Roblox Tower Battles?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.17,0:03:14.68,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,It is a bit different.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:15.82,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Yea, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.05,0:03:17.47,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Roblox Tower Battles
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.55,0:03:17.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yea, yea. THAT Roblox Tower Battles. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.20,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Bruhhhhhhhhh
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.22,0:03:20.12,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, there was a Tower Battle in Roblox?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:21.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehahah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.82,0:03:21.67,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Multiple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:22.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.53,0:03:23.35,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,They're multiple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:26.03,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I only remembered playing FPS games on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.15,0:03:27.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like Arsenal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:28.22,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,There were even knock-offs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.75,0:03:30.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, not Arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.33,0:03:31.45,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Call of Duty ones, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.17,0:03:31.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Phantom Forces?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.45,0:03:32.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Phantom Forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.93,0:03:33.35,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Ah yeah, Phantom Forces. That one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:33.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:34.37,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Yea, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.72,0:03:35.98,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,FANTOME FORCES
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.37,0:03:35.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.98,0:03:39.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Anyways, welcome back those- returning viewers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:40.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back. Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.18,0:03:42.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Those who are new here, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:43.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.52,0:03:44.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:45.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I can't think of things to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.17,0:03:49.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh, that's because you have nothing to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.67,0:03:50.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe?-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:52.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, everyone mute your Discords. Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:53.07,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Welp. As they say, third time's the charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.78,0:03:55.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be using the PEAK voice chat, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.33,0:03:57.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.13,0:03:58.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.98,0:04:01.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(970.667,425)}Pure silence...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:03.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot to turn on the audio for my PEAK. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.90,0:04:06.32,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else's voices are in full blast,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:09.40,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,while this guy's voices are fucking soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.30,0:04:10.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:12.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Right, so we're in PEAK once again,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.67,0:04:12.93,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5}*bonk*
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.40,0:04:13.00,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Alright... 70% percent...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.67,0:04:13.75,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.67,0:04:14.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and, um, ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.55,0:04:14.73,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Welp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.55,0:04:15.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.27,0:04:17.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,For those who have seen the PEAK highlights that we had,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.85,0:04:20.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,um, some time ago, or a couple of days ago, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.25,0:04:20.57,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.67,0:04:21.17,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5}*Tranquilizer shot*
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.57,0:04:23.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, what the fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.50,0:04:24.60,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,*losing it*
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.57,0:04:24.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Previously on PEAK Highlights Episode 1
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:28.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Then, you should expect similar levels of comedy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.37,0:04:29.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,happening here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:29.83,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:31.37,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully, we don't mess something up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.37,0:04:35.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, on top of that, we've also added a small number of mods
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.55,0:04:38.43,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5}*crash*
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.77,0:04:38.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,to hopefully QOL, fix some stuff, small stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:40.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and also to support more players.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.62,0:04:41.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like, we got five people now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.85,0:04:44.65,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,And when the maximum is four...
