Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.38,0:09:15.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Hehahahahahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:16.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Opium? Where?"
