Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.28,0:09:24.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Tch- For research purposes, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.60,0:09:26.47,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Ah yes, for sure it is for "research purposes".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.60,0:09:28.98,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me. I am a proven researcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.60,0:09:28.98,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.12,0:09:31.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god. Alex, you speedrunner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:33.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,My girlfriend may not be here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:36.03,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,HUH??????????
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.87,0:09:36.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but we now have the male equivalent of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.03,0:09:37.17,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just getting the loot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.25,0:09:37.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:39.95,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Oooh, another cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.03,0:09:40.42,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,He's speed-stealing,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:40.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Are you playing Apex Legends or are you playing PEAK?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:43.68,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna steal more stuff so he can blow everyone up
