Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.68,0:09:46.75,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,and lose all of the things he collected.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:50.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,For everyone's context, we did a technical test last night
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:53.38,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh, there's a rescue claw there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.33,0:09:54.48,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.43,0:09:55.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and while we were up a certain corner of a mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.27,0:09:55.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.48,0:09:56.85,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Short version: He blew us all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.85,0:09:59.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Alex accidentally stepped on something explosive
