Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:08.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:08.98,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}HHHHHH-HEHEHEHEHE
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.57,0:10:10.25,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,XD
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.25,0:10:11.27,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,I would never...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:16.52,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,He may or may not have been a terrorist when he was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:16.92,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Would you- would you mind taking this rescue cl-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:18.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Dash?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.05,0:10:19.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Are you down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.23,0:10:21.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh-h
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.17,0:10:22.60,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I'm down here at the crevice because im holding the rescue claw
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.22,0:10:23.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,W-What the...
