Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:42.47,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Boys and girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.67,0:10:44.72,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,And a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.05,0:10:46.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:48.85,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,And a terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:50.03,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Hahahahaha
