Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.23,0:10:51.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Tch-hehahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.37,0:10:53.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, totally.\NGender: Terrorist
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:54.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Hehehehe
