Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.67,0:10:56.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.75,0:10:58.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,To those regular viewers, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.42,0:10:59.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:03.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down, relax, and get a cold, chill drink to have, to enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.82,0:11:08.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Whereas my drink today is coconut juice or coconut water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:09.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, y'all are cli-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.55,0:11:11.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Pl- please don't push me off. Please don't push me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.55,0:11:11.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Heheh
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.98,0:11:12.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.37,0:11:12.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.67,0:11:12.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Heheh
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.25,0:11:13.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Heheh
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:13.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.37,0:11:14.92,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:18.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I just had some PTSD from this guy.
