Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.57,0:11:23.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I just had some PTSD from this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:27.52,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,I have PTSD from the terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.65,0:11:28.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,While I technically did not die in that explosion,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.43,0:11:30.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I did not fall off. I got pushed to a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.40,0:11:32.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But the other two fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:36.67,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:36.88,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,I was the victim of the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.98,0:11:38.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.33,0:11:40.10,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly, I was the witness, but I did not record it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.33,0:11:40.10,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:43.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"surely things will go well this time" Yup.
