Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:46.17,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dash Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.17,0:11:48.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,On the bright side, everyone's alive right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:49.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and we got to the first campfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:53.97,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,So I heard we have multiple rescue claws. Four of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.30,0:11:55.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.07,0:11:57.72,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,W-m-m-where?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.28,0:11:57.80,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Nice! Anti-rope cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.23,0:11:59.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't giving it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:00.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I could not tr...
