Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:03.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Aheheheh
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.98,0:12:05.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:06.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I could not trust a cliff bomber to...
