Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.15,0:12:09.35,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.07,0:12:10.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And by the way, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.58,0:12:12.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,on top of what else you've lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.52,0:12:14.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,you've lost a cure-all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:14.40,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... morale boost?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.58,0:12:17.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost a cure-all during our technical test.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.55,0:12:19.90,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't loooooose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:20.18,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,-'s the new map. I hope you have fun, I know I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.10,0:12:20.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:23.75,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Ehhh, it just disappeared. I had nohing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.75,0:12:25.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, we have much more worries
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:27.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,than just arguing with each other.
