Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.43,0:12:37.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Holy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.95,0:12:38.02,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.90,0:12:38.02,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.17,0:12:39.10,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Depends on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.10,0:12:40.88,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have rescue claws, or...
