Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.22,0:12:43.52,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.02,0:12:43.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I do, but I'm not sure about the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.28,0:12:45.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa-ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:45.83,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't we just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:46.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.15,0:12:48.28,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Wai-where? Wh-where?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:48.83,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't we just go by foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.60,0:12:51.40,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,CH-HEHEHEHEHEHEHEH
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:52.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Wo-ha-HAHAHAHAAHAHAHAHAHA
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.65,0:12:52.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Haha
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.42,0:12:53.00,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:54.25,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Get in the cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.50,0:12:55.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.37,0:12:56.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We're flying towards there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.45,0:12:57.15,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.72,0:12:59.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Towards where Yannick is at.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.45,0:13:01.08,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I am not risking that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.45,0:13:01.08,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:01.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.45,0:13:02.85,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Why, it's perfectly safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.88,0:13:04.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:04.20,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,That's the minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.53,0:13:04.60,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not risking that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.08,0:13:06.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Frick, I can't see where I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.83,0:13:07.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Ahhhhh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.67,0:13:09.57,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you went to-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.28,0:13:11.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't... (stuttering)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:12.32,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,(indecipherable Robi speech)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.53,0:13:12.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't take damage, thankfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.32,0:13:13.00,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.20,0:13:14.48,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,No, I took a lot of damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.35,0:13:16.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that a-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.53,0:13:16.93,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I took a little tho
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.32,0:13:17.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ow-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.08,0:13:18.90,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.50,0:13:19.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,An upside down rope spool~
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.95,0:13:20.52,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,And if you drop it, it floats as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.52,0:13:22.17,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,So be aware of not dropping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:23.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.45,0:13:26.92,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,So if I drop this thing, it floats off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.15,0:13:27.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.45,0:13:28.82,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it floats all the way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:30.07,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Perfectly safe hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.97,0:13:30.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa. OH-HO-HO!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.63,0:13:31.40,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yea. That's the wind. Careful, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.57,0:13:32.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, crickey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:34.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,At least we have a wall to hold on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.72,0:13:37.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.13,0:13:37.95,Yannick Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.95,0:13:40.07,Yannick Default,,0,0,0,,I have pure aura to hold me in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.07,0:13:42.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,795)}Absolute Aura
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:43.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.10,0:13:44.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:45.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.82,0:13:46.22,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they DO EXIST! THEY DO EXIST!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.07,0:13:46.83,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Ow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.22,0:13:47.02,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}(WHEEZE)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:49.22,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Bruhhhhhhhhh
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.05,0:13:49.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,WHYYYYYY???
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.13,0:13:52.13,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Whyyy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.45,0:13:52.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Who stepped on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.65,0:13:52.67,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's certainly one of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.20,0:13:52.67,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:52.67,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.70,0:13:53.33,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.63,0:13:57.85,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have another hidden terrorist somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.90,0:13:58.58,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}UMMM...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:13:59.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.38,0:14:00.75,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, god. Damn
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.22,0:14:01.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,There's a terrorist among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.37,0:14:01.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.73,0:14:02.05,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,AMONGUS
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.63,0:14:02.15,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:04.63,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting, interesting. My stamina's cut in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.07,0:14:07.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, gee. I wonder why!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.78,0:14:09.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Hehehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.37,0:14:09.87,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.88,0:14:11.75,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,I blame Dasher.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.05,0:14:12.10,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, th-. There is a medicinal root right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.53,0:14:13.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Tch-hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.77,0:14:13.88,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Ope
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.17,0:14:13.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Bruh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.15,0:14:14.42,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Up...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.98,0:14:15.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.95,0:14:17.67,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(984,481)}I'M TAKING OFF!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.37,0:14:19.08,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:19.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}He- HAHAHAHAHAHAHA!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.35,0:14:21.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.77,0:14:24.52,Yannick Default,,0,0,0,,I hear something...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.10,0:14:26.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:26.35,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I think the only hardest part is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.35,0:14:28.05,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Where should we go from there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.57,0:14:29.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:31.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It did kind of quench my hunger,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:32.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,so you know what? Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.43,0:14:34.73,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,-cannon and an anti-rope cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.43,0:14:36.75,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,And a pi-ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.63,0:14:38.18,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,(corrects himself) piton.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:39.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on with his eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.00,0:14:39.92,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,How do I  get up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.33,0:14:41.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Why is your eyes glowing?
