Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.32,0:14:43.12,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Herobrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.22,0:14:44.47,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, probably got-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.22,0:14:45.78,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:49.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you're frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.37,0:14:49.30,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,The specialty of this place is the spores.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:50.93,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:51.68,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:53.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Nope- I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.62,0:14:54.17,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.17,0:14:54.75,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:55.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.60,0:14:57.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Hehehahahahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.60,0:14:59.93,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Bruh, you have NOTHING on your back but HOW?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.25,0:15:03.98,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows where the two coconuts went?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.18,0:15:06.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who took the other two. I know I took one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.12,0:15:07.00,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, who gave me a coconut in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:07.93,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Bruh, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:09.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Tch- hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.25,0:15:11.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Tch- hehehahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.52,0:15:11.72,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that's where one of them went.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.98,0:15:11.72,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.85,0:15:13.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.05,0:15:17.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.30,0:15:17.73,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Wind de-ahoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.05,0:15:20.35,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running, boys. Keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:22.72,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.72,0:15:24.58,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,(vocalizing)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.35,0:15:24.65,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Take me awayyyyyy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.78,0:15:25.90,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.33,0:15:28.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, first aid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.97,0:15:29.15,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,There's a first- first aid kit here and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.73,0:15:29.60,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Damn
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.90,0:15:29.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.87,0:15:30.30,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Yup
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.60,0:15:30.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone need healing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.95,0:15:31.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I don't. I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.68,0:15:32.30,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,I need...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:33.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Gee! I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:36.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because you followed the freaking wind, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:36.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.53,0:15:37.53,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Heeeeeeey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:38.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Tch-hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:40.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,God damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:42.23,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I mean... Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.23,0:15:42.85,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what the...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.85,0:15:43.43,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Ow?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:44.38,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}EYAAAAAHHHHHHHHHH!!!! (Mandrake)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.32,0:15:45.45,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's a mandrake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.45,0:15:46.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What the f-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.45,0:15:47.85,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mandrake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.82,0:15:49.18,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}EYAAAAAHHHHHHHHHH!!!! (Mandrake)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:50.18,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}AAAAAAAAAAAAA!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.27,0:15:50.18,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting slee-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.03,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody just eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.27,0:15:54.22,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you can't take it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.92,0:15:57.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.67,0:15:58.20,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, who picked that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.87,0:15:58.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,There goes all my-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.55,0:16:00.88,Yannick Default,,0,0,0,,It appears I have no health.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.47,0:16:04.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Where went my other...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:07.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Where went my other half of coconut?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:09.50,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.68,0:16:10.80,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.10,0:16:10.80,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,I stole it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.68,0:16:10.80,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.22,0:16:15.08,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I ate it and now my stamina is mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.82,0:16:15.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Heh
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.98,0:16:17.45,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we want to go up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.90,0:16:20.70,Yannick Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna go up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.17,0:16:23.53,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think- no. I don't think we want to.
