Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.43,0:16:25.43,Yannick Default,,0,0,0,,I would wonder. (?)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.18,0:16:29.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with the spores?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.93,0:16:29.62,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Dunno, there should be a path up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.97,0:16:31.43,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Who wants to be the lucky patient zero?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.57,0:16:32.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Tch-hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.80,0:16:34.23,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Then where should we go then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.52,0:16:35.03,Yannick Default,,0,0,0,,I think I lost some health.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:36.48,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Dasher, Dasher Dasher.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.35,0:16:37.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,U- Ohhhhohoho
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.48,0:16:37.52,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Dasher, where you at?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.73,0:16:38.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Where did-?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.52,0:16:38.87,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,W- Wanna trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.87,0:16:40.08,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna tradeeeee?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.23,0:16:42.90,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,The other gun? You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.97,0:16:45.15,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,The safety one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.15,0:16:47.18,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,You mean this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.35,0:16:49.25,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? >:D
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.43,0:16:50.68,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Welp, alright then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:50.68,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.22,0:16:51.75,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Have at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.22,0:16:52.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Trade offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:53.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.42,0:16:55.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take the scout cookieeeeeees.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.18,0:16:55.32,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.32,0:16:56.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I almost fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.55,0:16:57.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.03,0:16:57.90,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what the?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.90,0:16:58.28,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,(click tongue)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.25,0:16:58.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:16:59.62,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.62,0:17:00.62,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Who stepped on it?
