Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.03,0:27:32.30,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, round 2 is the same map again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.30,0:27:33.53,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,You know where to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.53,0:27:33.85,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.15,0:27:34.33,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.55,0:27:35.85,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Oh joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.42,0:27:38.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up y'all. I'm getting a coconut.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.10,0:27:42.13,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wait, where's Bing Bong?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.13,0:27:44.07,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,We might as well take it for the achievement.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.32,0:27:44.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Tch-heheheheh
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.50,0:27:45.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,My god.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.62,0:27:46.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.73,0:27:47.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,All the coconut's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.47,0:27:50.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.77,0:27:52.93,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an6}*thonk*
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.35,0:27:52.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.30,0:27:54.57,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Ow
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.27,0:28:00.88,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you looking at me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.65,0:28:01.83,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.15,0:28:07.08,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,(She) wants to molest you, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.25,0:28:08.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,H-H-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.33,0:28:18.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"sounds like a car revving but a mosquito sound effect"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.08,0:28:21.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,According to Tove in the chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.12,0:28:22.08,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,A mosquito driving a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.77,0:28:22.08,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\c&H13DEF7&\an5\pos(938.667,310)}ToveNero: {\c&HFFFFFF&}sounds like a car\Nrevving but mosquito sound effect\N>~<
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.12,0:28:23.73,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,A mosquito drifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.35,0:28:25.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That is the most useless rope spool I've ever seen so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.08,0:28:25.83,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.80,0:28:27.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.67,0:28:30.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.48,0:28:31.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay. ARGH!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.60,0:28:32.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,(struggling)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.13,0:28:32.78,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}He-hahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.15,0:28:34.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I took damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.20,0:28:37.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let me the strength of your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.77,0:28:39.88,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5}*thonk*
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.55,0:28:42.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Eheheheheheheheh
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.68,0:28:42.80,Yannick Default,,0,0,0,,Aughhhh....
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.68,0:28:44.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Heheheheheheheh
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.88,0:28:46.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What is that? It looks like a piton.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.63,0:28:46.88,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Just grab the rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.28,0:28:49.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a piton.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.40,0:28:49.77,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,It's a rope. Just grab it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.43,0:28:52.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's a rope. It looks like a piton.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.02,0:28:55.25,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,You just jump to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.47,0:28:57.37,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,(mysterious Robi speech)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.80,0:28:58.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.65,0:29:00.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need some bandages later.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.60,0:29:05.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Cause, cause, cause ain't no insurance gonna cover that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.28,0:29:06.45,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we put another coconut in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.32,0:29:08.55,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,*thud*
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.95,0:29:09.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.53,0:29:12.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Dang it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.25,0:29:13.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.22,0:29:16.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's, there's like a, ow, ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.25,0:29:18.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I just, I got pricked. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.27,0:29:20.15,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Y'okay there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.02,0:29:20.45,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.72,0:29:21.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Nope. No stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.28,0:29:23.75,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Welp.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.10,0:29:25.07,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, where's the rope?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.48,0:29:26.52,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,You guys have the rope?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.40,0:29:28.83,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.47,0:29:31.30,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Is it still down-
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.60,0:29:31.38,Yannick Default,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.60,0:29:31.73,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I never seen the rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.30,0:29:32.48,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Is the rope still down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.48,0:29:33.88,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, give me, give me the rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.20,0:29:34.08,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.13,0:29:36.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yannick, do you have space in your inventory?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.00,0:29:39.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, Dash, Dash, Dash, Dash. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.67,0:29:41.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yannick, do you have space in your inventory?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.65,0:29:43.65,Yannick Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.85,0:29:45.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.88,0:29:47.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.97,0:29:48.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Arghhh
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.83,0:29:50.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Fuck. Hahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.17,0:29:51.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Welp.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.83,0:29:52.25,Yannick Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can catch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.63,0:29:53.48,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, was that a coconut flying?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.53,0:29:53.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Ehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.93,0:29:55.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Well, guess not then.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.87,0:29:55.85,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Just u(se the rope).
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.45,0:29:57.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Tch-hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.20,0:29:59.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,God damn it, Robi.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.22,0:30:01.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Are you just playing the,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.88,0:30:04.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,are you just playing the bugle whenever you had the chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.90,0:30:06.65,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.97,0:30:07.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Tch-hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.00,0:30:08.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.90,0:30:09.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.58,0:30:13.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I may be, I may be damaged by- stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.35,0:30:14.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm, I'm, I'm-
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.37,0:30:15.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,stop,  stop, stop, stop, stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.45,0:30:19.05,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, after this you'll be getting here doing damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.28,0:30:19.05,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.88,0:30:20.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.17,0:30:21.20,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, I have a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.53,0:30:25.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, just, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.78,0:30:29.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Feck's sake, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.52,0:30:31.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You're like an insurance company.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.47,0:30:33.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"We, we suck out as much money as we can
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.75,0:30:35.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,until we have to help you."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.30,0:30:37.18,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.18,0:30:38.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Hehehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.07,0:30:38.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,God damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.07,0:30:40.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{ytshake} Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.80,0:30:44.53,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,But preferably, we never have to help you. Heh
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.47,0:30:45.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Tch-hehehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.08,0:30:50.67,Yannick Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.08,0:30:51.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Elo. :)
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.50,0:30:51.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.65,0:30:53.50,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there~
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.80,0:30:57.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my God, the fucking speedrunner's all the way up there.\NHehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.67,0:30:58.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.80,0:30:59.90,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}EHEHEHEHEHEHE
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.38,0:31:00.62,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Bruh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.82,0:31:01.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Heheh, the fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.65,0:31:03.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That, that, that guy's a worse speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.98,0:31:06.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,the worse speedrunner than my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.33,0:31:07.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow your lead, Dash.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.28,0:31:09.08,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.23,0:31:09.08,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.20,0:31:09.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.75,0:31:10.32,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.75,0:31:10.32,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.47,0:31:12.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, KZF1 bandaged me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.03,0:31:13.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, (I) should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.05,0:31:14.83,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.15,0:31:16.27,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.45,0:31:17.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Tch- Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.63,0:31:19.70,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,I never left you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.98,0:31:21.82,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Hehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.25,0:31:25.43,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly. KZF1 appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.25,0:31:26.00,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, you were ahead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.32,0:31:27.25,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Tch-hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.20,0:31:28.58,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.65,0:31:30.10,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, where are the others though?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.02,0:31:31.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not s-
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.13,0:31:34.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Robi should be...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.00,0:31:37.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, he's all the way back here (there).
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.98,0:31:39.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,He's all the way back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.35,0:31:43.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Robi and, uh, and Yannick in theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.37,0:31:45.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I know for a fact that, Rob...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.37,0:31:48.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Robi's down there cause I can see his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.02,0:31:50.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's Yannick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.13,0:31:50.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Eheheh
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.68,0:31:52.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, you're sooner than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.42,0:31:54.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I thought, I thought you'd be further back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.92,0:31:57.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Over here, up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.32,0:31:57.78,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what's on top?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.38,0:31:59.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.92,0:32:01.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Is Robbie alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.18,0:32:04.05,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5}*toot*
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.15,0:32:05.50,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5}*toot*
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.50,0:32:06.40,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Oh~
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.27,0:32:10.65,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5}*toot*
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.65,0:32:11.80,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5}*toot**toot**toot*
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.80,0:32:12.97,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,*toot*
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.85,0:32:17.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I hear the bugle getting closer and closer by the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.95,0:32:20.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not sure if it's Robi's bugle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.88,0:32:22.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.28,0:32:22.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.75,0:32:25.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Tch-hehahe my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.23,0:32:27.73,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Man, man with the bugle can you just shut up about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.57,0:32:28.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The- hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.13,0:32:28.75,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.47,0:32:31.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The bugle came very handy to say the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.65,0:32:33.05,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Heheh
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.07,0:32:33.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.57,0:32:36.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Can't light campfi-" Oh wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.07,0:32:43.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get around th' campfire and sing the campfire song~\N(Spongebob reference)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.42,0:32:48.92,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,"Touch"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.58,0:32:49.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Our C-A-M-P-F-I-R-E-S-O-N-Ghhhhhh
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.43,0:32:51.20,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Touch~
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.02,0:32:52.45,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Time for Round two.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.22,0:32:53.38,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Touuuuuuch~
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.17,0:32:57.28,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.00,0:32:57.97,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Man, we don't have the cannon this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.67,0:32:59.72,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Thankfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.03,0:33:00.42,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,-venture time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.20,0:33:01.93,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Did someone bring a cannon?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.00,0:33:02.37,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.17,0:33:02.75,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wait. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.02,0:33:06.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.92,0:33:09.67,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,He alread- He already went ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.70,0:33:09.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, that fucking speedrunner's at it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.88,0:33:12.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That fucking speedrunner's at it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.00,0:33:14.13,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,He left without considering his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.92,0:33:16.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We're technically not friends to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.45,0:33:17.93,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.07,0:33:19.47,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.02,0:33:21.30,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Another medicinal root.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.47,0:33:22.93,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.25,0:33:23.63,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Nice, it's not a mandrake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.10,0:33:25.75,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.22,0:33:27.35,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.10,0:33:28.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I got just the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.38,0:33:29.52,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.42,0:33:29.68,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just lift me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.05,0:33:30.88,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Probably, yeah.
