Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.08,0:37:07.27,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.27,0:37:10.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. How do we get up there?
