Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.27,0:37:44.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Eheh- Frick.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.92,0:37:48.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I landed next to an already pulled out Mandrake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.73,0:37:50.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy. Hehehe
