Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.17,0:37:52.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.07,0:37:54.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I think I might recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.97,0:37:58.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.00,0:38:00.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But the Mandrake is probably gonna- yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.47,0:38:01.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Eheheh
