Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.52,0:39:17.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That was really a gamer save. Holy...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.18,0:39:19.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hell yeah.
