Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.08,0:39:45.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's got a mandrake, that's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.25,0:39:45.70,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.18,0:39:49.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're dead? Dang.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.77,0:39:54.32,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I- I tried to do a backflip on the thingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.15,0:39:56.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Pf- Backflip? That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.80,0:39:56.58,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,And it just threw me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.23,0:39:59.10,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,They are- They are almost up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.48,0:40:01.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,They're almost up?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.00,0:40:03.40,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.87,0:40:05.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Are they getting close to the campfire?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.42,0:40:07.90,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.17,0:40:09.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Should we die?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.15,0:40:13.02,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,But if you do, you have to do it stylishly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.65,0:40:14.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Stylishly?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.27,0:40:17.42,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Like, like a backflip.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.90,0:40:22.33,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,You're just ju-
