Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.82,0:40:26.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Is this stylish enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.13,0:40:26.83,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,You just jumped into a bomb, do a hard-
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.32,0:40:27.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Hehehahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.20,0:40:29.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, welcome to Jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.83,0:40:31.35,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,You just jumped into a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.30,0:40:32.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And- And you're watching the Disney Channel. Hohoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.72,0:40:35.93,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.72,0:40:35.93,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Y'dying~
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.48,0:40:37.17,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,You're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.87,0:40:38.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.82,0:40:38.87,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,No? You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.90,0:40:46.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hellu~
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.72,0:40:50.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Did you throw the mandrake to the far left side?
