Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.08,0:40:54.03,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.78,0:40:54.03,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.40,0:40:55.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Because you didn't throw far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.18,0:40:58.28,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.12,0:41:00.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I landed on it when I got blown off by the wind
