Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.65,0:41:02.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Heheha
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.85,0:41:08.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.80,0:41:09.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.65,0:41:13.18,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the thing saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.25,0:41:15.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What? The wall?
