Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.67,0:41:30.95,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.22,0:41:32.80,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,I am one with the mushroom.
