Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.40,0:42:35.15,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe. I thought Brian flew down. Hehehehhh
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.15,0:42:36.92,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god, that was scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.50,0:42:36.92,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.20,0:42:38.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We're watching competitive peak.
